  "body": "Location simply doesn't get much better than this.\r\nThis exceptional family home enjoys what can only be described as a \"stone's throw\" location to Macleans College. Families will love the convenience of having Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary all within an easy stroll from home.\r\nUpstairs Features\r\n•Light-filled open-plan living and dining area\r\n•Designer kitchen with excellent bench space and storage\r\n•Spacious lounge featuring a cosy gas fireplace\r\n•Seamless flow to a sunny balcony, perfect for relaxing or entertaining\r\n•Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n•Enjoy a glimpse of the sea from the master suite\r\n•Additional bedroom ideal as a child's room, guest room, or home office\r\n•Separate guest toilet for added convenience\r\nDownstairs Features\r\n•Two generous double bedrooms\r\n•Full family bathroom\r\n•Additional living area, ideal for teenagers, extended family, or guests\r\n•Double internal-access garage with integrated laundry area\r\n•Flexible layout offering privacy and separation for growing families\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n•Macleans College is directly across the road - it's hard to get any closer\r\n•Walking distance to Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain Primary\r\n•Easy stroll to Macleans Park for sports, recreation, and family activities\r\n•Minutes from Eastern Beach and Bucklands Beach\r\n•Short drive to Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry services\r\n•Close to Howick Village, Highland Park Shopping Centre, cafes, and restaurants\r\nOverseas owners are committed to achieving a sale. Properties in this location are tightly held, and opportunities to secure a home this close to Macleans College rarely become available. This is an opportunity not to be missed.",
